OL,3,GCentral, Tayside & Fife
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FRain, with some hill snow
OL,6,Facross Perthshire, will slowly clear
OL,7,Fthis morning but may linger across the
OL,8,Ffar east until early afternoon.
OL,9,FOtherwise becoming dry with some
OL,10,Fsunshine, east last to brighten up.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FThis evening will be dry with
OL,13,Fsome frost and fog patches. Then it
OL,14,Fwill stay dry for the rest of the
OL,15,Fnight but clouding over later.
OL,16,
OL,17,CSaturday:FAfter a dry start it will be
OL,18,Fa cloudy day with a chance of rain
OL,19,Fspreading north in the afternoon, but
OL,20,Fmore especially in the evening.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
