OL,3,GCentral, Tayside & Fife
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Sunday to Tuesday:FBright
OL,6,Fspells and a few showers on Sunday.
OL,7,FMild and windy with rain on Monday in
OL,8,Fthe west, mostly dry in the east.
OL,9,FMainly dry and bright on Tuesday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
